   <media:description>“Wassup,&quot; COER! Ever wanted to know what’s in @cortis_bighit's group chat? Their new album “GREENGREEN” FINALLY dropped, so we asked James, Juhoon, Martin, Seonghyeon, and Keonho to take a “Joyride” through their Watch History.

Things that show up in this include everything from why Mbappe is the GOAT, to their “FaShioN” inspo, to which member had to search “how to tie a tie.” The self-produced K-pop group even gets into what hip-hop artists inspire their songwriting process and some pre-debut content. It’s as explosive as “TNT.”

